</style><h2>BlinkyBot 0.2.0</h2><ul><li><strong>BlinkyBot packages the OpenBOT desktop.</strong> The Mac app name is BlinkyBot. The source is this OpenBOT tree.</li><li><strong>Disk image and zip.</strong> The release is <code>BlinkyBot-0.2.0.dmg</code> and <code>BlinkyBot-0.2.0.zip</code> for Apple Silicon. Docker is not required.</li><li><strong>Signed update feed.</strong> The zip is signed for BlinkyBot&#x27;s existing update key. This build has no in-app updater yet, so install the disk image.</li><li><strong>MIT license.</strong> Source for this version is git tag <code>v0.2.0</code>. The license text is <code>LICENSE</code>.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-bot/releases/tag/v0.2.0">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
